{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:55 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:55 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:55 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/7ee602e9a12202f89e321d5bcd739092/2026-11/179379322966807.jpg\"/><p>今晚第二場賽事後，賽馬事務執行總監夏定安與女騎師奧璇璧會見傳媒，兩人在欄邊攝影區供傳媒拍攝。</p><p>奧璇璧將於本周日的婦女銀袋賽馬日在港初次登場，她未上陣已深受歡迎，早已卜定當日十匹坐騎，包括出戰婦女銀袋賽的游廄「銀亮奔騰」。</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧（左）與夏定安握手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/309db7668d92ab3daaad97a59124b86a/2026-11/179379325661097.jpeg\" title=\"奧璇璧（左）與夏定安握手。\"/><p>奧璇璧（左）與夏定安握手。</p><img alt=\"奧璇璧笑容燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7369eb0be871fdd1b7f8969a7f268577/2026-11/179379325611964.jpeg\" title=\"奧璇璧笑容燦爛。\"/><p>奧璇璧笑容燦爛。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.647701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:55:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:18:47.532116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:42.329627+00:00","content_hash":"71adf55045abc045277080d0cd947cf48158928fac3930a2ae2fb17be7cdee15","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}